  "headline": "Run Time vs. Dev Time",
  "alternativeHeadline": "Collapsing the Impedance Mismatch Between Authoring Semantics and Global Edge Execution",
  "description": "Modern web stacks accumulate layers of build-time abstraction that obscure what actually executes at request time. By pairing semantic HTML5, native CSS state machines (:has()), and edge-native SSR on Cloudflare Workers + EmDash 1.0, teams collapse middleware tax and ship systems whose dev-time mental model matches their run-time reality.",
